;(Talk to Starskiff Pilot)
:'''Starskiff Pilot:''' Would you like to board my starskiff?
:You keenly notice that the foxian passengers near the Starskiff Pilot are looking you up and down.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Yes, but we have several passengers...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How many passengers can you accommodate?
:'''Starskiff Pilot:''' Well, my little starskiff can't accommodate that many... but I have a larger one that will arrive in less than fifteen minutes if you need it. So, where would you like to go?
:'''Starskiff Pilot:''' We need to hurry, wherever we're going. The Wardance is about to start, and the Sky-Faring Commission is prioritizing starskiffs heading to the Skysplitter.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Have the Cloud Knights closed the ports?
::'''Starskiff Pilot:''' Closed the ports...? Why would they do that?
::{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I want to get outside the Jade Gate. Can you take me there?
::'''Starskiff Pilot:''' What? Are you joking? How can I take you beyond the Jade Gate in this tiny starskiff?
::{{tx}}
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} {{Цвет|Огненный|Can we keep this quiet?}}
::'''Starskiff Pilot:''' Keep what quiet? Hahahahaha! Come on, spill it if you have something to say.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} {{Цвет|Огненный|Can you give me a ride out of here?}}
:::'''Starskiff Pilot:''' You want to leave alone now? Sure, the starting fare is six strales. Where do you want to go?
:::{{tx}}
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} {{Цвет|Огненный|Could you deliver a message to the Realm-Keeping Commission for me?}}
:::'''Starskiff Pilot:''' The Realm-Keeping Commission? It's right up ahead. Look, I've got a business to run, so why don't you go there yourself?
:::{{tx}}
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Never mind. I just wanted to ask if your starskiff is safe enough.
:::'''Starskiff Pilot:''' Hah! I've been in this business for almost a century! You won't find a safer starskiff around here!
:::{{tx}}


;(Talk to Cloud Knights Soldier)
