===Return to Hoolay and negotiate with him{{subst:void|<!--202220311-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}
;(По прибытии на место)

;(По прибытии на место)
;(If {{F|MissionCV-2022203-undefined}} is not undefined 0, {{F|MissionCV-2022203-1}} is not undefined 0, and {{F|MissionCV-2022203-2}} is not undefined 0)
